{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOChipPicker"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOChipPickerV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MISOChipPicker","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOChipPicker"}]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"filter chips"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and proposing single or multiple selections."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-31j3k","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-8fuc0","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-1lbr4","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-9jopu","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOChipPicker"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Tag"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each chip contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose choosen values through this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOFilterChip","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPickerData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in filter chip using MISOChipPickerData.","    enum Drink: String, CaseIterable {","        case virginHolyLava, ipaBeer, mineralWater","    }","","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISOChipPickerData<Drink>] {","        [","            MISOChipPickerData(tag: Drink.virginHolyLava,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Virgin Holy Lava\", image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")))),","","            MISOChipPickerData(tag: Drink.ipaBeer,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"IPA Beer\", image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")))),","","            MISOChipPickerData(tag: Drink.mineralWater,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Mineral water\", image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")))),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/\/ Single selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: Drink = .mineralWater","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    MISOChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selection: $selection, chips: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/\/ Multiple selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [Drink] = [.mineralWater]","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    MISOChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selections: $selections, chips: someDataToPopulate)"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.17.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misochippicker"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOFilterChip":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOFilterChip","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOFilterChip","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Filter chip is a UI element that allows to select or deselect an option within a series, and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Filter chip allows to filter content by being selected or deselected."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can be toggled “On” or “Off” to refine displayed results, and selected Filter Chips remain visually distinct to indicate active filters."}],"title":"MISOFilterChip","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOFilterChip"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misofilterchip","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOChipPicker":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOChipPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker